      <AccordionItem title="Director">
        <CaseCard
          id="comedy-central"
          imageSrc={blogPlaceholder2}
          imageAlt="Comedy Central Collage"
          reverse
        >
          From pacing to design, Andy’s guiding star with directing is
          resonating with the audience. Whether it’s building on the latest
          trends or cultural moments, he seeks to connect with the audience on a
          human level.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="comedy-central"
          title="Comedy Central Digital"
          imageSrc={blogPlaceholder2}
          imageAlt="Comedy Central Collage"
        >
          As a Social Producer on Comedy Central's Webby-winning digital team,
          Andy spearheaded directing on multiple projects like <i>Mini-Mocks</i
          >, music videos, and other original content collaborations with
          notable influencers.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="snapchat"
          title="Making It"
          imageSrc={blogPlaceholder2}
          imageAlt="Comedy Central Collage"
          reverse
        >
          As Director, Cinematographer, and Editor, Andy brought an original
          vertical series to life for Snapchat's <i>Snap Originals</i>.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard2 imageSrc={dbh} imageAlt="Death Becomes Her" className="w-2xl">
          <span slot="title">Death Becomes Her<br/> Broadway BTS Promos</span>
          <span slot="copy">Director | Producer | Editor</span>
        </CaseCard2>
        <CaseCard2 className="w-2xl aspect-video">
          <div slot="background" class="flex border-radius-lg">
            <video
              src={"/videos/rizzle1.mp4"}
              class="rizzlevideo"
              autoplay
              loop
              muted
              playsinline></video>
            <video
              src={"/videos/rizzle2.mp4"}
              class="rizzlevideo"
              autoplay
              loop
              muted
              playsinline></video>
            <video
              src={"/videos/rizzle3.mp4"}
              class="rizzlevideo"
              autoplay
              loop
              muted
              playsinline></video>
          </div>
          <span slot="title">Rizzle's <br/>Asian Comedy Fest</span>
          <span slot="copy">$1000 Grand Prize winner for a new vertical series!</span>
        </CaseCard2>
        <CaseCard
          id="other-directing"
          title="Shorts & More"
          imageSrc={blogPlaceholder2}
          imageAlt="Shorts and more"
        >
          Andy has written, directed, and produced on a wide array of projects
          ranging from branded content to comedy shorts, music videos, and more.
          https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_98xIvAvOhE
        </CaseCard>

        <section
          id="rizzle"
          class={`case-card flex gap-4 md:gap-8 flex-col my-8`}
        >
          <div class="flex-1 flex-col justify-end my-auto">
            <h3 class="text-center font-bold">Rizzle</h3>
            <p class="text-center hidden md:px-24 md:block">
              Created a series of videos for vertical platform Rizzle and won
              $1000 in its Asian Comedy Festival Competition.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 flex">
            <video
              src={"/videos/rizzle1.mp4"}
              class="rizzlevideo"
              autoplay
              loop
              muted
              playsinline></video>
            <video
              src={"/videos/rizzle2.mp4"}
              class="rizzlevideo"
              autoplay
              loop
              muted
              playsinline></video>
            <video
              src={"/videos/rizzle3.mp4"}
              class="rizzlevideo"
              autoplay
              loop
              muted
              playsinline></video>
          </div>

          <p class="text-center md:px-24 md:hidden"></p>
        </section>
        <CaseCard
          id="polygon"
          title="Polygon Labs Spec Spot"
          imageSrc={polygon}
          imageAlt="Polygon Labs Spec Spot"
        >
          Pitched a flagship spot for Polygon Labs, translating his
          understanding of web3 infrastructure into a relatable concept.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="instant-magenta"
          title="Producing & Other Creative Services"
          imageSrc={blogPlaceholder2}
          imageAlt="Instant Magenta Collage"
          reverse
        >
          From editing for Hollywood socials to full-service promos for Broadway
          productions, Andy can lend a hand through his production arm <a
            href="www.instantmagenta.com"
            class="text-nowrap"
            target="_blank">Instant Magenta</a
          >.
        </CaseCard>
      </AccordionItem>
      <AccordionItem title="Technologist">
        <CaseCard
          id="tech"
          videoSrc="/videos/Tootsies Promo v1_2_400.mp4"
          reverse
        >
          With a background in Mathematics & Computer Science, Andy has always
          embraced the technical aspects of production. From coding custom After
          Effects scripts to niche immersive workflows, he enjoys the tinkering.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard id="tech" videoSrc="/videos/Head to Head_640.mp4">
          Andy's breadth of experience includes traditional 3D tools such as
          Unreal Engine, Unity, Blender, and more.
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard id="ai" videoSrc="/videos/AI Sample_400.mp4" reverse>
          But Andy also knows how to grow with the times, dabbling in AI-driven
          generative workflows from platforms like Higgsfield and Kling to
          API-driven bespoke applications such as ComfyUI and Veo3.
        </CaseCard>
      </AccordionItem>
      <AccordionItem title="Weirdo">
        <CaseCard
          id="pissterine"
          imageSrc={pissterine}
          imageAlt="Pissterine"
          reverse
        >
          Andy once kickstarted a Listerine knockoff that got shutdown in
          trademark court.<video
            src={"/videos/pissterine.mp4"}
            class="h-1/2"
            autoplay
            loop
            muted
            playsinline></video></CaseCard
        >
        <CaseCard
          id="tootsies"
          title="Tootsie's Video Vault"
          imageSrc={tootsies}
          imageAlt="Tootsie's Video Vault Collage"
        >
          Andy is a co-producer on annual Brooklyn film jam <a
            href="https://tootsiesvideovault.com"
            class="text-nowrap"
            target="_blank">Tootsie's Video Vault</a
          >.
          <Image src={tootsies2} alt="Step and Repeat at Tootsies" />
        </CaseCard>
        <CaseCard
          id="about"
          imageSrc={azaleaShoot}
          imageAlt="About Andy Collage"
          reverse
        >
          Andy lives in Brooklyn with his wife and collaborator Katie Sicking
          and their daughter Azalea.</CaseCard
        >
      </AccordionItem>
      <Footer />
      <script>
        import "../face-tracker.js";
      </script>
    </main>

    <style>
      .title {
        font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 15rem);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      main {
        padding: 1em;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        max-width: 1280px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .rizzlevideo {
        width: 33.33%;
        height: auto;
      }

      /* Container sizes to SVG; face-tracker is overlaid and centered in the circle */
      .face-container {
        position: relative;
        display: none;
        width: min(70vw, 70vh);
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        container-type: size;
      }

      .circular-labels {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        fill: currentColor;
        display: block;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;
      }

      .face-container .face-tracker {
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 50%;
        height: 50%;
        border-radius: 50%;
        min-height: 0;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .circle-label {
        --label-size: 2rem;
        font-size: var(--label-size);
        cursor: default;
        transition: font-size 0.2s ease;
      }
      .circle-label:hover {
        font-size: calc(var(--label-size) * 1.1);
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
